### Works with the VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Plan and deploy a release
POST {{base}}/api/releases
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": "1.4.2", "scheduledAt": "2026-11-05T22:00:00+08:00", "notes": "Search index changes" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/releases/1.4.2/deploy

### Open a P1 incident caused by that release
POST {{base}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Payment gateway rejects transactions", "service": "Payments", "severity": "P1", "openedBy": "service.desk", "causedByReleaseVersion": "1.4.2" }

### Acknowledge (replace INC-1000 with the ref returned above)
POST {{base}}/api/incidents/INC-1000/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{ "by": "duty.engineer" }

### Resolve
POST {{base}}/api/incidents/INC-1000/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "by": "duty.engineer", "summary": "Renewed the gateway client certificate" }

### Open incidents past their resolve deadline
GET {{base}}/api/incidents?breachingOnly=true

### SLA compliance, last 30 days
GET {{base}}/api/reports/sla

### Change failure rate, last 180 days
GET {{base}}/api/reports/change-failure-rate
